            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PWHITTEN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought the directions were a little confusing: 'Add sweet potatoes, boiling water, and salt to a large saucepan' should read 'Add sweet potatoes and salt to boiling water.' \r\n\r\nMy family does not like SWEET sweet potatoes, so I omitted the corn syrup in step 2, and used the juice of a whole orange instead. In step 3, I drained the potatoes after cooking, without saving any liquid, since I did not need it.\r\n\r\nI prepared the potatoes ahead of time and put them into a casserole with the orange juice sauce and pieces of oranges. I also added 1/2 c. chopped pecans. I covered the dish and heated the dish in the oven (350) for about 1/2 hour instead of finishing on the stove-top."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ljcintx"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cubed sweet potatoes, made it without corn syrup &amp; used OJ concentrate. I used Swerve, a healthier sugar option, but it really didn't need any extra sweetness. I will skip it next time. I substituted peeled &amp; separated cuties for orange slices.",
            "datePublished": "2023-11-25T23:12:31.273Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pokawa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for our Christmas dinner and got many compliments on it. The orange flavor was perfect - not too strong or weak, and it wasn’t so overpoweringly sweet as the marshmallow recipes are - very fitting for someone trying to keep from gaining weight over the holidays.",
            "datePublished": "2019-01-02T03:54:05.507Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
